                  "blocker": "DESIGN_APPROVAL_REQUIRED",
                  "evidence": [
                    "方案选项 conditional-key-stop-report：Change only storyloop/stop_report.py. A new private helper (named in the design prose; it is not declared as an existing symbol) projects the saved consistency findings: it keeps only blocking==True items and maps each one to exactly {target, severity:'阻塞', message, location}. message and location go through processutil.redact and are then bounded with redaction_prefix so that target+severity+message+location stay within 300 characters. build_stop adds stop['review_findings'] only when status is DESIGN_REVISION_REQUIRED and the list is non-empty. stop_of adds the same key in memory to legacy saved DESIGN_REVISION_REQUIRED stops that lack it, taken from run.planning.consistency, and never saves. render_stop adds a '方案阻塞意见：' section, one line per finding, between questions and options. run, status and log already share these three functions, so every view gets the same summary.（全文：.storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan）",
                    "涉及文件：storyloop/stop_report.py、tests/test_design_revision_findings.py",
                    "Risks：sensitive: yes、migration: no、external_contract: yes、new_interface: yes、crosscut: yes、principle_deviation: no、hard_verify_high_cost: no、dependency_swap: no；共 11 项，完整内容见 .storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan",
                    "Decisions：1. **Choice:** change only storyloop/stop_report.py. **Rationale:** every consumer meets there. **Alternatives considered:** adding the list in consistency.py or cli_output.py, which spreads one change over several modules and misses the log view or the old saved stops. 2. **Choice:** add review_findings only when status == DESIGN_REVISION_REQUIRED and at least one blocking finding exists. **Ratio…完整内容见 .storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan"
                  ],
